@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}
@tenantId = {{$dotenv TENANT_ID}}
@bearerToken = {{$dotenv TEST_BEARER_TOKEN}}

### Property access report (administrator): one property, date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/property-access?propertyId=1&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Property access report, one gate only
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/property-access?propertyId=1&gateId=1&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Property access report - missing propertyId (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/property-access?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Access now: per-property counts of people on site (administrator)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/access-now
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
